    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Limited Time Event: Critical Cargo is here for the summer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Among Us 3D </i>is a party game of teamwork and betrayal. Grab your crew of 4-10 players and launch into a fully 3D version of the beloved social deduction game. Work together as Crewmates to complete tasks before one or more Impostors kill everyone aboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> <i>Among Us 3D </i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.poster.avif?t=1755192723\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.webm?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.mp4?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the core <i>Among Us</i> gameplay you know and love, such as tasks, sabotages, Emergency Meetings, and venting \u2014 now in 3D!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as either Crewmate or Impostor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 <strong>Crewmate Mission</strong>: Complete all the tasks or eject the Impostor. Keep your eyes and ears open - someone could be lurking right around the corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 <strong>Impostor Mission</strong>: Sabotage and kill the Crewmates! Frame the crew, sneak through the vents, and craft the perfect lie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.poster.avif?t=1755192723\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.webm?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.mp4?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch things up with Tag Mode and regular Limited Time Events!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing <strong>The Infected</strong>! In Tag Mode, it\u2019s Infected versus Crewmates. <strong>The Infected </strong>try to catch and infect all the Crewmates to expand their ranks before the Crewmates can finish a set number of tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Time Events</strong> change the experience even more. From experimental gameplay, to unique cosmetic styles, regular <strong>Limited Time Events</strong> bring something new and exciting throughout the year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/9f5fcffe9acd3647a0ca5f733a2743e2.poster.avif?t=1755192723\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/9f5fcffe9acd3647a0ca5f733a2743e2.webm?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/9f5fcffe9acd3647a0ca5f733a2743e2.mp4?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy returning crew favorite tasks, reimagined with innovative and immersive first-person controls. Beware the Impostor while you try your hand at all new tasks, too! Customize your gameplay, comfort, and safety settings to build the best experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lobby up and connect with millions of other Crewmates \u2014 including <i>Among Us 3D: VR</i> players! \u2014 with native crossplay. Create custom lobbies for you and your closest pals with unique and personalized settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> <i>Among Us 3D </i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/346858b51d06a1cdcc102d4f1e11b505.poster.avif?t=1755192723\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/346858b51d06a1cdcc102d4f1e11b505.webm?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/346858b51d06a1cdcc102d4f1e11b505.mp4?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion your Crewmate with an endless number of color, hat, glove, and skin combinations. Expand your wardrobe even more with Stardust. Purchase this in-game currency* to spend on additional cosmetics and let your true style shine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong>: Stardust is not compatible with and cannot be converted to or from currencies in the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/00ff799096a90e19135a0bca6096f5c8.poster.avif?t=1755192723\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/00ff799096a90e19135a0bca6096f5c8.webm?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/00ff799096a90e19135a0bca6096f5c8.mp4?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with or betray your friends using your preferred method of communication:<br>\u2014 Yap away with native, proximity voice chat.<br>\u2014 No more need for external apps for chatting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Not a talker? Use intuitive and efficient Quick Text Chat options to stay communicative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Express yourself through your hands with the all-new Gesture system.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Limited Time Event: Critical Cargo is here for the summer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Among Us 3D </i>is a party game of teamwork and betrayal. Grab your crew of 4-10 players and launch into a fully 3D version of the beloved social deduction game. Work together as Crewmates to complete tasks before one or more Impostors kill everyone aboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> <i>Among Us 3D </i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.poster.avif?t=1755192723\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.webm?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.mp4?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the core <i>Among Us</i> gameplay you know and love, such as tasks, sabotages, Emergency Meetings, and venting \u2014 now in 3D!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as either Crewmate or Impostor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 <strong>Crewmate Mission</strong>: Complete all the tasks or eject the Impostor. Keep your eyes and ears open - someone could be lurking right around the corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 <strong>Impostor Mission</strong>: Sabotage and kill the Crewmates! Frame the crew, sneak through the vents, and craft the perfect lie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb