asks, reimagined with innovative and immersive first-person controls. Beware the Impostor while you try your hand at all new tasks, too! Customize your gameplay, comfort, and safety settings to build the best experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lobby up and connect with millions of other Crewmates \u2014 including <i>Among Us 3D: VR</i> players! \u2014 with native crossplay. Create custom lobbies for you and your closest pals with unique and personalized settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> <i>Among Us 3D </i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/346858b51d06a1cdcc102d4f1e11b505.poster.avif?t=1755192723\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/346858b51d06a1cdcc102d4f1e11b505.webm?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/346858b51d06a1cdcc102d4f1e11b505.mp4?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion your Crewmate with an endless number of color, hat, glove, and skin combinations. Expand your wardrobe even more with Stardust. Purchase this in-game currency* to spend on additional cosmetics and let your true style shine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong>: Stardust is not compatible with and cannot be converted to or from currencies in the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/00ff799096a90e19135a0bca6096f5c8.poster.avif?t=1755192723\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/00ff799096a90e19135a0bca6096f5c8.webm?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/00ff799096a90e19135a0bca6096f5c8.mp4?t=1755192723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with or betray your friends using your preferred method of communication:<br>\u2014 Yap away with native, proximity voice chat.<br>\u2014 No more need for external apps for chatting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Not a talker? Use intuitive and efficient Quick Text Chat options to stay communicative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Express yourself through your hands with the all-new Gesture system.</p>",
